{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel><data id=\"items\" expr=\"[1, 2]\"/><data id=\"total\" expr=\"0\"/></datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <if cond=\"\">\n        <log expr=\"'yes'\"/>\n      <elseif cond=\"\"/>\n        <log expr=\"'maybe'\"/>\n      </if>\n      <foreach array=\"\" item=\"\">\n        <log expr=\"'each'\"/>\n      </foreach>\n      <assign location=\"\" expr=\"1\"/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"done\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"done\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":5,"warnings":5},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":229,"endColumn":17,"endLine":5,"startColumn":17,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":"…"}}]}],"description":{"text":"fill in `cond`"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":18,"endLine":5,"startColumn":11,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`cond` on `<if>` is empty\n\n**Note:** `cond` is required on `<if>`; an empty value is no expression at all, so every time it runs it raises `error.execution` (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\")\n\n**Help:** write the condition this `<if>` tests; a last branch that always runs is written as `<else/>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.12 <if>","text":"`cond` on `<if>` is empty"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":230,"start":223},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML066"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":280,"endColumn":21,"endLine":7,"startColumn":21,"startLine":7},"insertedContent":{"text":"…"}}]}],"description":{"text":"fill in `cond`"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":22,"endLine":7,"startColumn":15,"startLine":7}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`cond` on `<elseif>` is empty\n\n**Note:** `cond` is required on `<elseif>`; an empty value is no expression at all, so every time it runs it raises `error.execution` (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\")\n\n**Help:** write the condition this `<elseif>` tests; a last branch that always runs is written as `<else/>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.12 <if>","text":"`cond` on `<elseif>` is empty"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":281,"start":274},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML066"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":348,"endColumn":23,"endLine":10,"startColumn":23,"startLine":10},"insertedContent":{"text":"…"}}]}],"description":{"text":"fill in `array`"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":24,"endLine":10,"startColumn":16,"startLine":10}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`array` on `<foreach>` is empty\n\n**Note:** `array` is required on `<foreach>`; an empty value is no expression at all, so every time it runs it raises `error.execution` (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\")\n\n**Help:** write the collection to iterate in `array`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.6 <foreach>","text":"`array` on `<foreach>` is empty"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":349,"start":341},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML066"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":356,"endColumn":31,"endLine":10,"startColumn":31,"startLine":10},"insertedContent":{"text":"…"}}]}],"description":{"text":"fill in `item`"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":32,"endLine":10,"startColumn":25,"startLine":10}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`item` on `<foreach>` is empty\n\n**Note:** `item` is required on `<foreach>`; an empty value is no expression at all, so every time it runs it raises `error.execution` (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\")\n\n**Help:** write the loop variable in `item`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.6 <foreach>","text":"`item` on `<foreach>` is empty"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":357,"start":350},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML066"},{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":429,"endColumn":25,"endLine":13,"startColumn":25,"startLine":13},"insertedContent":{"text":"…"}}]}],"description":{"text":"fill in `location`"},"properties":{"applicability":"has-placeholders"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml066-empty-required-attributes.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":26,"endLine":13,"startColumn":15,"startLine":13}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`location` on `<assign>` is empty\n\n**Note:** `location` is required on `<assign>`; an empty value is no expression at all, so every time it runs it raises `error.execution` (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\")\n\n**Help:** write the location to assign in `location`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.4 <assign>","text":"`location` on `<assign>` is empty"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":430,"start":419},"category":"lint"},"ruleId":"SCXML066"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"`<if>`/`<elseif>` `cond`, `<foreach>` `array` and `item`, and `<assign>` `location` are required; an empty value is no expression at all, so it raises `error.execution` every time it runs (SCXML 1.0 §5.9.4: the processor \"MAY wait and place 'error.execution' in the internal event queue at runtime when the expressions are evaluated\"; §5.9.1: a condition is then false), and the document still compiles"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: write the condition, collection, loop variable, or location; a last `<if>` branch that always runs is written as `<else/>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.12 <if>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML066` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#if","id":"SCXML066","name":"SCXML066","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a required expression attribute is empty"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}